AltoMarket::SetMaxLtv
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert
└── when caller is owner
    ├── when maxLtv is greater than MATH_PRECISION
    │   └── it should revert
    ├── when maxLtv is greater than maxLiquidationLtv
    │   └── it should revert
    ├── it should update maxLtv
    └── it should emit SetMaxLtv event 